(1726629, 232342, 43463, '<td valign="top">The composition is good with a tight focus on the cat studying the bubble. Love how the cat''s eyes are focused intently on the bubble. The black background draws the eyes attention directly to the cat and the bubble.</td>', 'The composition is good with a tight focus on the cat studying the bubble. Love how the cat''s eyes are focused intently on the bubble. The black background draws the eyes attention directly to the cat and the bubble.', '2005-09-21 10:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
