(1726989, 233764, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow, just one bubble!  I like it how the top and bottom of the bubble reflect the background colours.  And I LOVE the circle of colours around the inside/outside of the bubble.  Amazing how bubbles, even though they must be very light, still have weight and create a "dimple" in the liquid.  Simple, effective and beautiful.</td>', 'Wow, just one bubble!  I like it how the top and bottom of the bubble reflect the background colours.  And I LOVE the circle of colours around the inside/outside of the bubble.  Amazing how bubbles, even though they must be very light, still have weight and create a "dimple" in the liquid.  Simple, effective and beautiful.', '2005-09-21 12:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727004, 233907, 5112, '<td valign="top">Lovely!</td>', 'Lovely!', '2005-09-21 12:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727012, 233963, 31403, '<td valign="top">that''s a drop, not a buble - I know, technically there''s a bubble in the drop - however...<br/> <br/>But this is a terrific photo.  The DOF works so well to make the scale feel large, and I love the contrast of the dark greens behind.  I''m not a fan of floral shots at all, but I love this one - do you feel special?<br/> <br/>I hope this is helpful to you in some way.  Water drop challenge 7  Bubble challenge 5</td>', 'that''s a drop, not a buble - I know, technically there''s a bubble in the drop - however... But this is a terrific photo.  The DOF works so well to make the scale feel large, and I love the contrast of the dark greens behind.  I''m not a fan of floral shots at all, but I love this one - do you feel special? I hope this is helpful to you in some way.  Water drop challenge 7  Bubble challenge 5', '2005-09-21 12:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727030, 234287, 31403, '<td valign="top">this would be really cool with some color!  I accidentally found that if you set your WB wrong, it adds color to your shot.  So shooting this with a flourescent light setting would have introduced some cool cyan color into the greys. Or my 10 year old made a gel for me by coloring on saran wrap with a magic marker - <br/> <br/> A skosh more contrast would be better for me, but it''s really cool the way it is.  Hope that''s helpful.</td>', 'this would be really cool with some color!  I accidentally found that if you set your WB wrong, it adds color to your shot.  So shooting this with a flourescent light setting would have introduced some cool cyan color into the greys. Or my 10 year old made a gel for me by coloring on saran wrap with a magic marker -   A skosh more contrast would be better for me, but it''s really cool the way it is.  Hope that''s helpful.', '2005-09-21 12:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727039, 231949, 31403, '<td valign="top">those are drops, not bubbles - so you understand why I''m voting lower.  Love the colors, great DOF.  It is an excellent photo you should be proud of.</td>', 'those are drops, not bubbles - so you understand why I''m voting lower.  Love the colors, great DOF.  It is an excellent photo you should be proud of.', '2005-09-21 12:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727043, 233832, 43463, '<td valign="top">An interesting bunch of reflections there on this half sphere....I am trying to figure out what it is that I am seeing as that it looks like some interesting abstract art at the present moment. But that is this shots allure. It keeps you looking.</td>', 'An interesting bunch of reflections there on this half sphere....I am trying to figure out what it is that I am seeing as that it looks like some interesting abstract art at the present moment. But that is this shots allure. It keeps you looking.', '2005-09-21 12:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727047, 232469, 31403, '<td valign="top">Cropping to just the bubble would make this much stronger for me.  The skyline really doesn''t add much, except to make the title clear.  That beautiful gradient with the neat colors in the bubble would be all I need to see to really love this.  5</td>', 'Cropping to just the bubble would make this much stronger for me.  The skyline really doesn''t add much, except to make the title clear.  That beautiful gradient with the neat colors in the bubble would be all I need to see to really love this.  5', '2005-09-21 12:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
