(1727060, 234470, 31403, '<td valign="top">a very interesting take on the challenge!  I''ll be she was glad you thought of this way too, kept her dry.<br/> <br/>As an image it doesn''t quite work for me, but I don''t know how you would have done it differently so it would be more striking.  How''s that for feedback?  It''s not striking to me, but I don''t know how to help.<br/> <br/>Excellent creative though - 6</td>', 'a very interesting take on the challenge!  I''ll be she was glad you thought of this way too, kept her dry. As an image it doesn''t quite work for me, but I don''t know how you would have done it differently so it would be more striking.  How''s that for feedback?  It''s not striking to me, but I don''t know how to help. Excellent creative though - 6', '2005-09-21 12:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
