(1727121, 231904, 43463, '<td valign="top">The composition of the elements is definately interesting but I think that the border is a little too much. Yes it does make the composition pop off the page but I think that if there was a little more dimension to the edges of the "black box area" it would move it out of the realm of flat and give it a third dimension and some depth....I am thinking that if the shot could have been accomplished with a box where the inside is deep black and the outside is white....just a random thought.<br/> <br/>Back to the composition. I like how you have the flower curved such that it looks as if it is resting comfortabley on the bubble. The bubble is in focus but some of the details in the seperation in the flower petals are lost - it needs to be in focus better to improve sharpness so that we can appreciate the beauty of the flower as well as the bubble.</td>', 'The composition of the elements is definately interesting but I think that the border is a little too much. Yes it does make the composition pop off the page but I think that if there was a little more dimension to the edges of the "black box area" it would move it out of the realm of flat and give it a third dimension and some depth....I am thinking that if the shot could have been accomplished with a box where the inside is deep black and the outside is white....just a random thought. Back to the composition. I like how you have the flower curved such that it looks as if it is resting comfortabley on the bubble. The bubble is in focus but some of the details in the seperation in the flower petals are lost - it needs to be in focus better to improve sharpness so that we can appreciate the beauty of the flower as well as the bubble.', '2005-09-21 12:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727122, 234277, 31403, '<td valign="top">very pretty, nice lighting - 7 for now - will revisit</td>', 'very pretty, nice lighting - 7 for now - will revisit', '2005-09-21 12:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727123, 232288, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great image! Looking forward to the details. The title brings it to a 10. Good luck!</td>', 'Great image! Looking forward to the details. The title brings it to a 10. Good luck!', '2005-09-21 12:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
