(1727152, 233242, 43463, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot of a frog! But because the majority of the bubbles are located in the far right top half they easily get lost into the background. The frog dominates the photo. Perhaps a tighter focus on just the face of the frog with the bubbles taking up half of the photo space would have given us a stronger connection to bubbles. Not only that the spherical shape of the frog''s eye would compliment the spherical shapes of the bubbles and with a closer view the viewer can more readily make that connection.</td>', 'This is a great shot of a frog! But because the majority of the bubbles are located in the far right top half they easily get lost into the background. The frog dominates the photo. Perhaps a tighter focus on just the face of the frog with the bubbles taking up half of the photo space would have given us a stronger connection to bubbles. Not only that the spherical shape of the frog''s eye would compliment the spherical shapes of the bubbles and with a closer view the viewer can more readily make that connection.', '2005-09-21 12:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727155, 233872, 33542, '<td valign="top">I love the idea, but there are several things I think would have made this picture a little better. First, it would have made a beautiful serious picture (no spitting). Second, it is a little out of focus and the whites are a little blown. You might try a faster shutter time, even though the rice pellets wouldn''t have the same effect. Finally, the cropping is a little off, imo. I''d have included the top of the man''s head and the edge of the bouquet and cropped off the girl on the left side, or included more people on the side so the girl isn''t so prominent. Good luck!</td>', 'I love the idea, but there are several things I think would have made this picture a little better. First, it would have made a beautiful serious picture (no spitting). Second, it is a little out of focus and the whites are a little blown. You might try a faster shutter time, even though the rice pellets wouldn''t have the same effect. Finally, the cropping is a little off, imo. I''d have included the top of the man''s head and the edge of the bouquet and cropped off the girl on the left side, or included more people on the side so the girl isn''t so prominent. Good luck!', '2005-09-21 12:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727160, 231727, 33542, '<td valign="top">Very crisp, but the liney-ness around some of the out of focus bubbles makes me think they were a little oversharpened.</td>', 'Very crisp, but the liney-ness around some of the out of focus bubbles makes me think they were a little oversharpened.', '2005-09-21 12:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727164, 231754, 33542, '<td valign="top">fan in the background is distracting, as is light over man''s face (although I''m not sure about creating a reflection with the light elsewhere.</td>', 'fan in the background is distracting, as is light over man''s face (although I''m not sure about creating a reflection with the light elsewhere.', '2005-09-21 12:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727172, 233402, 33542, '<td valign="top">awww very cute... three small criticisms... 1. was there a bubble above the baby? I think it would have been better not to crop that one out so we could see what he/she was reaching for. 2. the picture feels a little tipped to me (left side seems higher than right). 3. a crop with the baby more to one side or the other might have been better. Overall a great picture, though. I like the coloring.</td>', 'awww very cute... three small criticisms... 1. was there a bubble above the baby? I think it would have been better not to crop that one out so we could see what he/she was reaching for. 2. the picture feels a little tipped to me (left side seems higher than right). 3. a crop with the baby more to one side or the other might have been better. Overall a great picture, though. I like the coloring.', '2005-09-21 12:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727176, 234155, 40371, '<td valign="top">The color reflections are great but I would have liked to see a more defined edge around the bubbles</td>', 'The color reflections are great but I would have liked to see a more defined edge around the bubbles', '2005-09-21 13:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727182, 234177, 43463, '<td valign="top">The idea is good but the execution could be better. I like how you use the element of the wine and the wine glasses but I think this entry could have been much stronger if you had zoomed in on your focus. There is too much background that is distracting the eye from the main focus and that is the bubbles in the wine glass. If you zoomed in on just one wine glass where we just see half of it in the picture you would have the pleasing curve of the glass for the eye to look at and study. The viewer would also see the stream of wine being poured into the glass and the bubbles that result from that action. Also the reds of the wine could be deeper and more rich in hue if you used a black background.</td>', 'The idea is good but the execution could be better. I like how you use the element of the wine and the wine glasses but I think this entry could have been much stronger if you had zoomed in on your focus. There is too much background that is distracting the eye from the main focus and that is the bubbles in the wine glass. If you zoomed in on just one wine glass where we just see half of it in the picture you would have the pleasing curve of the glass for the eye to look at and study. The viewer would also see the stream of wine being poured into the glass and the bubbles that result from that action. Also the reds of the wine could be deeper and more rich in hue if you used a black background.', '2005-09-21 13:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727186, 231905, 14805, '<td valign="top">great concept!!! if you would have used better lighting, this would have ribboned.</td>', 'great concept!!! if you would have used better lighting, this would have ribboned.', '2005-09-21 13:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727193, 233943, 42025, '<td valign="top">unless this is a macro of a bubble and your getting a shot of the clolr streaks in it.. it does not fit the challange. Also the color is not that vivid or focused</td>', 'unless this is a macro of a bubble and your getting a shot of the clolr streaks in it.. it does not fit the challange. Also the color is not that vivid or focused', '2005-09-21 13:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727198, 234579, 43463, '<td valign="top">I love that intense stare on the child as he/she holds in his open hand these delicate soap bubbles!  Focus is tight and details in the overall composition are sharp as a tack. The bubble is presented to us on a child''s open hand and it is almost like he/she is offering it to us. The other way of looking at this scene is that we, the viewers, are invited to intensely gaze upon this bubble like the child is doing. And we do, we gaze intently on the child and the bubble as we are captivated at looking at this scene. Great job here!</td>', 'I love that intense stare on the child as he/she holds in his open hand these delicate soap bubbles!  Focus is tight and details in the overall composition are sharp as a tack. The bubble is presented to us on a child''s open hand and it is almost like he/she is offering it to us. The other way of looking at this scene is that we, the viewers, are invited to intensely gaze upon this bubble like the child is doing. And we do, we gaze intently on the child and the bubble as we are captivated at looking at this scene. Great job here!', '2005-09-21 13:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
