(1727213, 232886, 43463, '<td valign="top">There on the far dunes lies a world held within a delicate sphere. It''s ecosystem can disappear at any moment. That is/are the thoughts that crosses my mind when I gaze upon this image. Very visually poetic, serene, scenic, and dreamy. I love how the bubble captures the orange glow from the setting sun for it makes that bubble appear truly magical. Wonderful job!</td>', 'There on the far dunes lies a world held within a delicate sphere. It''s ecosystem can disappear at any moment. That is/are the thoughts that crosses my mind when I gaze upon this image. Very visually poetic, serene, scenic, and dreamy. I love how the bubble captures the orange glow from the setting sun for it makes that bubble appear truly magical. Wonderful job!', '2005-09-21 13:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
