(1727248, 234624, 43463, '<td valign="top">This is a really fun one and it shows with the model. She has a slight smile and twinkle in her eye. I see that you had the model wear pigtails so that it invokes a sense of an innocent girl blowing a bubble - but then you pair it with the  double meaning that adds just a sense of naughtiness to add some spice to the "sugar and nice". The pink background compliments the bubblegum bubble not to mention pink is symbolically for girls. The critiques I have for this photo is that the model could look like she is a little more "bubbley" - more smile. Also I am not to keen on the overexposure of the far top right portion of the photo - It washes out the pink background which as I said is complimentary to the overall photo.</td>', 'This is a really fun one and it shows with the model. She has a slight smile and twinkle in her eye. I see that you had the model wear pigtails so that it invokes a sense of an innocent girl blowing a bubble - but then you pair it with the  double meaning that adds just a sense of naughtiness to add some spice to the "sugar and nice". The pink background compliments the bubblegum bubble not to mention pink is symbolically for girls. The critiques I have for this photo is that the model could look like she is a little more "bubbley" - more smile. Also I am not to keen on the overexposure of the far top right portion of the photo - It washes out the pink background which as I said is complimentary to the overall photo.', '2005-09-21 13:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
