(1727294, 231786, 43463, '<td valign="top">I like the color hues and the elements in this one but the composition suffers. This could have been much stronger if you centered the glass with the escaping bubble in the frame AND had the circular object in the background more in the frame such that you see it''s full curves on both the right hand side and left hand side. If that background object showed it''s full curves on both sides the viewer would more strongly connect it with a spherical object and thus it''s connection to the escaping bubble in the glass and bubbles in general would be fully realized.</td>', 'I like the color hues and the elements in this one but the composition suffers. This could have been much stronger if you centered the glass with the escaping bubble in the frame AND had the circular object in the background more in the frame such that you see it''s full curves on both the right hand side and left hand side. If that background object showed it''s full curves on both sides the viewer would more strongly connect it with a spherical object and thus it''s connection to the escaping bubble in the glass and bubbles in general would be fully realized.', '2005-09-21 13:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727304, 233410, 33696, '<td valign="top">I would have seen this photo bigger, but hey, 9</td>', 'I would have seen this photo bigger, but hey, 9', '2005-09-21 13:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727316, 232415, 43463, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. I like how you paired the  a delicate soap bubble that is shiny &amp; smooth to contrast with  a heavy rusted chain that shows a bumpy &amp; rough texture.</td>', 'Interesting composition. I like how you paired the  a delicate soap bubble that is shiny & smooth to contrast with  a heavy rusted chain that shows a bumpy & rough texture.', '2005-09-21 13:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727333, 234634, 43463, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant, and clean is this capture. The blue sky and white clouds are the perfect companions to this shot - The spherical shape of the bubble that is in wonderful focus invokes our thoughts to planet Earth.</td>', 'Simple, elegant, and clean is this capture. The blue sky and white clouds are the perfect companions to this shot - The spherical shape of the bubble that is in wonderful focus invokes our thoughts to planet Earth.', '2005-09-21 13:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727343, 233849, 39278, '<td valign="top">really cool...how did u manage to take this photo? anyway, very well done!</td>', 'really cool...how did u manage to take this photo? anyway, very well done!', '2005-09-21 13:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727353, 234459, 40371, '<td valign="top">What a cool plant!  The bubbles are good too but man, that plant is unreal.</td>', 'What a cool plant!  The bubbles are good too but man, that plant is unreal.', '2005-09-21 13:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727357, 234360, 41029, '<td valign="top">not a bubble there.</td>', 'not a bubble there.', '2005-09-21 13:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727358, 234317, 39278, '<td valign="top">:)) funny guy!</td>', ':)) funny guy!', '2005-09-21 13:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727362, 231904, 39670, '<td valign="top">love the phot but IMO the border spoils it.</td>', 'love the phot but IMO the border spoils it.', '2005-09-21 13:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727369, 233831, 42389, '<td valign="top">Great one. REALLY want to know how you managed to get the girl in focus.. while background is blurred out. Just amazed.</td>', 'Great one. REALLY want to know how you managed to get the girl in focus.. while background is blurred out. Just amazed.', '2005-09-21 13:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727370, 233764, 42405, '<td valign="top">wonderful<br/>you could put this in rule of thirds too<br/>i love this come<br/>-10-</td>', 'wonderfulyou could put this in rule of thirds tooi love this come-10-', '2005-09-21 13:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727375, 234462, 43463, '<td valign="top">I can tell you I have to appreciate the persistence it took to just get this shot - animals are tough subjects to work with. I like the action going on in this shot. The beta/siamese fighting fish looks as if it is blowing those bubbles from its mouth. The biggest flaw of this shot is the washed out colors. Betas have rich colors and th blues and reds could be deeper and richer in hue - perhaps placing a black background behind the tank would help with making the colors pop and also if flash was used then maybe you should try a more natural lighting so the colors are not overexposed.</td>', 'I can tell you I have to appreciate the persistence it took to just get this shot - animals are tough subjects to work with. I like the action going on in this shot. The beta/siamese fighting fish looks as if it is blowing those bubbles from its mouth. The biggest flaw of this shot is the washed out colors. Betas have rich colors and th blues and reds could be deeper and richer in hue - perhaps placing a black background behind the tank would help with making the colors pop and also if flash was used then maybe you should try a more natural lighting so the colors are not overexposed.', '2005-09-21 13:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727376, 234362, 39560, '<td valign="top">This is a cute picture but the focal point should be the bubbles not the little boy. I think the bubbles shoud be in focus and the boy blurred out.</td>', 'This is a cute picture but the focal point should be the bubbles not the little boy. I think the bubbles shoud be in focus and the boy blurred out.', '2005-09-21 13:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727380, 233050, 39278, '<td valign="top">how the hell did you take this photograph??</td>', 'how the hell did you take this photograph??', '2005-09-21 13:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727389, 232342, 34283, '<td valign="top">Knowing cats'' behaviour, I suspect it took a while to take this shot, mut the result is fantastic.</td>', 'Knowing cats'' behaviour, I suspect it took a while to take this shot, mut the result is fantastic.', '2005-09-21 13:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727390, 234498, 41029, '<td valign="top">Image is slightly hazy</td>', 'Image is slightly hazy', '2005-09-21 13:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727391, 234277, 43463, '<td valign="top">I really like the bubble action going on in this shot. But I think you could have focused in even more on the shot so the main dominient image is  just on the bubbles rising from the object in the beer. The yellow colors seen here tend to the warm hues and are rich in color and thus pleasing to the eye. I''m still trying to figure out what  the object is that is in the beer.....</td>', 'I really like the bubble action going on in this shot. But I think you could have focused in even more on the shot so the main dominient image is  just on the bubbles rising from the object in the beer. The yellow colors seen here tend to the warm hues and are rich in color and thus pleasing to the eye. I''m still trying to figure out what  the object is that is in the beer.....', '2005-09-21 13:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727393, 233403, 34283, '<td valign="top">Great pic, but where are the bubbles?</td>', 'Great pic, but where are the bubbles?', '2005-09-21 13:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727396, 234176, 39560, '<td valign="top">I see where you were going with this but it needs bubbles. Other than that I like the shot, set-up and idea. Nice pic</td>', 'I see where you were going with this but it needs bubbles. Other than that I like the shot, set-up and idea. Nice pic', '2005-09-21 13:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727399, 232637, 34283, '<td valign="top">I''m not an expert, but I would crop it on the right to get rid of the seaweeds and the pic would be even better and more dramatic.</td>', 'I''m not an expert, but I would crop it on the right to get rid of the seaweeds and the pic would be even better and more dramatic.', '2005-09-21 13:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727400, 231586, 43463, '<td valign="top">The colors are rich and deep in hue not to mention bold and vibrant. This is a very lively in bold hues and very abstract. These bubbles are very pleasing to the eye as the viewer gazes upon them.</td>', 'The colors are rich and deep in hue not to mention bold and vibrant. This is a very lively in bold hues and very abstract. These bubbles are very pleasing to the eye as the viewer gazes upon them.', '2005-09-21 13:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727402, 234049, 40371, '<td valign="top">Probably the best milk bubbles pic</td>', 'Probably the best milk bubbles pic', '2005-09-21 13:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727403, 234584, 34283, '<td valign="top">Great. Eeerm, but the bubbles?</td>', 'Great. Eeerm, but the bubbles?', '2005-09-21 13:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727409, 234566, 39560, '<td valign="top">I think this picture is way to busy for what the challenge is. Also I had to look for a bit to find the bubbles in the shot.</td>', 'I think this picture is way to busy for what the challenge is. Also I had to look for a bit to find the bubbles in the shot.', '2005-09-21 14:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727410, 233970, 40371, '<td valign="top">Probably the best "child blowing bubbles" pic</td>', 'Probably the best "child blowing bubbles" pic', '2005-09-21 14:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727419, 234406, 39560, '<td valign="top">Focus could be better.</td>', 'Focus could be better.', '2005-09-21 14:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
