(1727634, 233037, 43565, '<td valign="top">I could imagine bubbles where the water hits the ground, but I don''t see any.  I would have taken this at an angle that would have not shown part of the name.</td>', 'I could imagine bubbles where the water hits the ground, but I don''t see any.  I would have taken this at an angle that would have not shown part of the name.', '2005-09-21 15:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727638, 232288, 4477, '<td valign="top">Rule of thirds? ha  I love the water color below the bubbles, and the rainbow captured in the bubbles themselves.  Great macro!</td>', 'Rule of thirds? ha  I love the water color below the bubbles, and the rainbow captured in the bubbles themselves.  Great macro!', '2005-09-21 15:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727653, 232993, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, but wish there was more headroom for the yelow glass. Also the bubbles look like dishsoap which feels out of place to me. I keep asking myself why they''re there.</td>', 'I like the colors, but wish there was more headroom for the yelow glass. Also the bubbles look like dishsoap which feels out of place to me. I keep asking myself why they''re there.', '2005-09-21 15:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727658, 234284, 43565, '<td valign="top">I would like this better against a solid background.</td>', 'I would like this better against a solid background.', '2005-09-21 15:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727662, 232818, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective on the straw and the colors. The milk bubbles are ok, but I wish they were a stronger element in the picture - like they were larger or filled more of the glass.</td>', 'I like the perspective on the straw and the colors. The milk bubbles are ok, but I wish they were a stronger element in the picture - like they were larger or filled more of the glass.', '2005-09-21 15:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727670, 232342, 3554, '<td valign="top">I can imagine how hard it was to get this shot. Great expression and title.</td>', 'I can imagine how hard it was to get this shot. Great expression and title.', '2005-09-21 15:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727678, 232047, 3554, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand how this meets the challenge Also your picture is very small and hard to see. For your next submission I would suggest a larger picture. Use all 640 pixels you''re allowed.</td>', 'I don''t understand how this meets the challenge Also your picture is very small and hard to see. For your next submission I would suggest a larger picture. Use all 640 pixels you''re allowed.', '2005-09-21 15:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727686, 234069, 3554, '<td valign="top">Love this one with the two spheres, the sun''s light contrasting with th bubble.  I also really like the composition of this shot. The way the two line up. My eyes are drawn to both at once immediately. Well done! I do wish tehre wasn''t that artifact above and to the right of the bubble.</td>', 'Love this one with the two spheres, the sun''s light contrasting with th bubble.  I also really like the composition of this shot. The way the two line up. My eyes are drawn to both at once immediately. Well done! I do wish tehre wasn''t that artifact above and to the right of the bubble.', '2005-09-21 15:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727690, 234493, 43463, '<td valign="top">The red color is bold and vibrant and makes this photo really pop and capture the eye''s attention. I like the play of bubbles as they coat the surface of the rasberries. Clean and simple and appealing to the eye. Still, perhaps the composition would be stronger if you zoomed in for a closer look at the rasberries giving the viewer more texture to look at and maybe getting rid of the reflection on the side of the martini glass.</td>', 'The red color is bold and vibrant and makes this photo really pop and capture the eye''s attention. I like the play of bubbles as they coat the surface of the rasberries. Clean and simple and appealing to the eye. Still, perhaps the composition would be stronger if you zoomed in for a closer look at the rasberries giving the viewer more texture to look at and maybe getting rid of the reflection on the side of the martini glass.', '2005-09-21 15:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727698, 231727, 43463, '<td valign="top">A simple and clean abstract approach. We see bubbles within the bubbles and it gives the eye something extra to look at.</td>', 'A simple and clean abstract approach. We see bubbles within the bubbles and it gives the eye something extra to look at.', '2005-09-21 15:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727699, 231936, 42627, '<td valign="top">Sorry way to blurry</td>', 'Sorry way to blurry', '2005-09-21 15:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727708, 233642, 43463, '<td valign="top">The idea is good but I feel the framing of the composition could have been strengthen if you waited for the dog to look directly at you. That why we see the wet dog being given a bath that he doesn''t want as he looks at us imploringly (if you are lucky to capture an expression like that, it is not always easy) to "save him". By having the dog look at the viewer it brings us into the moment such that we feel that we are there looking back at the poor dog having a bath.</td>', 'The idea is good but I feel the framing of the composition could have been strengthen if you waited for the dog to look directly at you. That why we see the wet dog being given a bath that he doesn''t want as he looks at us imploringly (if you are lucky to capture an expression like that, it is not always easy) to "save him". By having the dog look at the viewer it brings us into the moment such that we feel that we are there looking back at the poor dog having a bath.', '2005-09-21 15:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727721, 233083, 24013, '<td valign="top">oh, this is sooo pretty!  everything is perfect.</td>', 'oh, this is sooo pretty!  everything is perfect.', '2005-09-21 15:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727743, 234584, 35382, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot, however I really don''t see how it fits the challenge</td>', 'This is a very nice shot, however I really don''t see how it fits the challenge', '2005-09-21 15:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727746, 233085, 3102, '<td valign="top">Where...?</td>', 'Where...?', '2005-09-21 15:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727748, 234426, 20530, '<td valign="top">Please don''t be offended, but this strikes me as a hasty, last minute snapshot. Don''t feel bad, though...I set up, shot and edited my shot 15 minutes before the deadline, and it''s really bombing! I gave this one points for having bubbles, but there isn''t much else that works for me.</td>', 'Please don''t be offended, but this strikes me as a hasty, last minute snapshot. Don''t feel bad, though...I set up, shot and edited my shot 15 minutes before the deadline, and it''s really bombing! I gave this one points for having bubbles, but there isn''t much else that works for me.', '2005-09-21 15:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727755, 232047, 20530, '<td valign="top">If you speak English, and this was a serious attempt at the Bubbles challenge, please PM me and request a more extensive comment. Otherwise, I don''t get it.</td>', 'If you speak English, and this was a serious attempt at the Bubbles challenge, please PM me and request a more extensive comment. Otherwise, I don''t get it.', '2005-09-21 15:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727767, 234361, 20530, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is a lava lamp? Aside from it meeting the challenge, there isn''t much that makes it work for me. It''s a good idea, though; and with a sharper focus, no glare and minus the overwhelming border, there is some potential.</td>', 'I''m guessing this is a lava lamp? Aside from it meeting the challenge, there isn''t much that makes it work for me. It''s a good idea, though; and with a sharper focus, no glare and minus the overwhelming border, there is some potential.', '2005-09-21 15:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727785, 231575, 43565, '<td valign="top">I think this would have looked better had the background been darker (like the upper right corner) so there would have been more contrast.</td>', 'I think this would have looked better had the background been darker (like the upper right corner) so there would have been more contrast.', '2005-09-21 16:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1727791, 233943, 43565, '<td valign="top">Not sure where the bubble is...I also wish the colors were more in focus.</td>', 'Not sure where the bubble is...I also wish the colors were more in focus.', '2005-09-21 16:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
