(1728133, 232605, 20530, '<td valign="top">It looks like the camera focused on the background instead of the bubble. The bubble seems to cast an interesting, rainbow shadow, but the background is so dark and wrinkled that it serves to distract.</td>', 'It looks like the camera focused on the background instead of the bubble. The bubble seems to cast an interesting, rainbow shadow, but the background is so dark and wrinkled that it serves to distract.', '2005-09-21 17:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728140, 234461, 42198, '<td valign="top">Technically perfect. The lighting and the backdrop are spot-on. Catch lights in the eyes are good. But the thing that makes this shot for me is the expression. Above all else that shows you have a certain amount of patience!</td>', 'Technically perfect. The lighting and the backdrop are spot-on. Catch lights in the eyes are good. But the thing that makes this shot for me is the expression. Above all else that shows you have a certain amount of patience!', '2005-09-21 17:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728141, 234538, 42198, '<td valign="top">Funny shot! - Looks like he''s mesmerised by the bubbles. Nicely composed too. The chain around his neck is a bit distracting. But that''s minor.</td>', 'Funny shot! - Looks like he''s mesmerised by the bubbles. Nicely composed too. The chain around his neck is a bit distracting. But that''s minor.', '2005-09-21 17:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728143, 234467, 21183, '<td valign="top">I''m looking closely at the photo but, unfortunately, can''t make out any bubbles.  The photo is smaller than it should be and appears to be out of focus. There are some interesting light reflections on the glass and the top of the glass looks like it might have an etched pattern on it, but isn''t clear because of the focus issue. It reminds me a bit of my own first challenge attempt.  I think there''ll be some intruction in the forums, somewhere, about image sizing for upload to the challenges, if not in the rules.  Hoping this won''t fare ''too'' badly for you.  It''s great fun learning and the challenges are great incentives, I think - hoping you agree.</td>', 'I''m looking closely at the photo but, unfortunately, can''t make out any bubbles.  The photo is smaller than it should be and appears to be out of focus. There are some interesting light reflections on the glass and the top of the glass looks like it might have an etched pattern on it, but isn''t clear because of the focus issue. It reminds me a bit of my own first challenge attempt.  I think there''ll be some intruction in the forums, somewhere, about image sizing for upload to the challenges, if not in the rules.  Hoping this won''t fare ''too'' badly for you.  It''s great fun learning and the challenges are great incentives, I think - hoping you agree.', '2005-09-21 17:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728147, 234367, 20530, '<td valign="top">That''s  a cute idea. It makes me ask questions, though: Why is the water dirty looking? Why is she wearing a bikini in the bath tub? Why is she sitting in the end of tub where the faucet pokes her? Isn''t that pose uncomfortable? Whether this is you, or a model, I''d try to get her in front of the camera as often as possible. I wish I had such a photogenic person to pose for me.</td>', 'That''s  a cute idea. It makes me ask questions, though: Why is the water dirty looking? Why is she wearing a bikini in the bath tub? Why is she sitting in the end of tub where the faucet pokes her? Isn''t that pose uncomfortable? Whether this is you, or a model, I''d try to get her in front of the camera as often as possible. I wish I had such a photogenic person to pose for me.', '2005-09-21 17:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728149, 234464, 20530, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and title. Sharper focus might have helped.</td>', 'Clever idea and title. Sharper focus might have helped.', '2005-09-21 17:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728151, 234069, 42198, '<td valign="top">This is brilliant. The bubble looks like it''s made of glass. Great use of light. I bet you wish you could have cloned out that spot just above the bubble! - But that''s a minor flaw here.</td>', 'This is brilliant. The bubble looks like it''s made of glass. Great use of light. I bet you wish you could have cloned out that spot just above the bubble! - But that''s a minor flaw here.', '2005-09-21 17:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728162, 233003, 20530, '<td valign="top">Unusual angle and crop. It really feels a bit awkward to me, and there isn''t enough in focus to hold my attention very long.</td>', 'Unusual angle and crop. It really feels a bit awkward to me, and there isn''t enough in focus to hold my attention very long.', '2005-09-21 17:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728175, 234494, 40371, '<td valign="top">I actually would have liked this better without the added figurine.</td>', 'I actually would have liked this better without the added figurine.', '2005-09-21 17:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728180, 234406, 21183, '<td valign="top">I like your title on this.  It certainly does make me think of an alien landscape, though I find myself wanting to find some point of focus on the photo.  My eye is drawn to the bubble at the bottom left, which doesn''t create a particularly good ''balance'' to the photo - for me anyway, and that is where I might begin to look to improve the image if it were mine.  It would be fascinating to learn what the reflections (if that''s what they are) are of.</td>', 'I like your title on this.  It certainly does make me think of an alien landscape, though I find myself wanting to find some point of focus on the photo.  My eye is drawn to the bubble at the bottom left, which doesn''t create a particularly good ''balance'' to the photo - for me anyway, and that is where I might begin to look to improve the image if it were mine.  It would be fascinating to learn what the reflections (if that''s what they are) are of.', '2005-09-21 17:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728182, 234152, 40371, '<td valign="top">That glare at the bottom of the bubble is a little distracting otherwise I would have given this a 9 or 10.  Great color scheme!</td>', 'That glare at the bottom of the bubble is a little distracting otherwise I would have given this a 9 or 10.  Great color scheme!', '2005-09-21 18:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728184, 233050, 40371, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!</td>', 'This is awesome!', '2005-09-21 18:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728193, 234462, 40371, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better if you had cropped off the top where the bubble line ends.  Nice job though, very original.  One of very few "pet" pics I like.</td>', 'I would have liked this better if you had cropped off the top where the bubble line ends.  Nice job though, very original.  One of very few "pet" pics I like.', '2005-09-21 18:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728199, 234462, 42198, '<td valign="top">This is great! - First time I''ve seen a photo of a fish that almost gives it an expression! He really looks like he''s enjoying himself there. Well caught.... erm captured (can''t use words like ''caught'' in front of a fish, you know)</td>', 'This is great! - First time I''ve seen a photo of a fish that almost gives it an expression! He really looks like he''s enjoying himself there. Well caught.... erm captured (can''t use words like ''caught'' in front of a fish, you know)', '2005-09-21 18:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728203, 233746, 42198, '<td valign="top">How did you do this? - It''s excellent. My eye is drawn to the ''creature'' descending on the top-right corner. Almost looks like he has eyes. I visualise this as aliens attacking a planet, the title was well chosen!</td>', 'How did you do this? - It''s excellent. My eye is drawn to the ''creature'' descending on the top-right corner. Almost looks like he has eyes. I visualise this as aliens attacking a planet, the title was well chosen!', '2005-09-21 18:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728213, 232605, 42198, '<td valign="top">The funny thing here is that I find the backdrop more interesting than the subject! - Having the bubble out of focus and fairly centered in the composition also tends to draw the eye to the backdrop. Nice title. And the shadow is pretty good (the faint pink in the shadow works well)</td>', 'The funny thing here is that I find the backdrop more interesting than the subject! - Having the bubble out of focus and fairly centered in the composition also tends to draw the eye to the backdrop. Nice title. And the shadow is pretty good (the faint pink in the shadow works well)', '2005-09-21 18:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728214, 233831, 42198, '<td valign="top">Now this one really caught my attention. How on earth did you manage this? Very creative and imaginative. Beautifully vibrant colours. Focus is excellent.</td>', 'Now this one really caught my attention. How on earth did you manage this? Very creative and imaginative. Beautifully vibrant colours. Focus is excellent.', '2005-09-21 18:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728221, 232342, 34048, '<td valign="top">I think this is absolutely adorable.</td>', 'I think this is absolutely adorable.', '2005-09-21 18:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728226, 234406, 42198, '<td valign="top">A very evocative image. I enjoyed this as my eye was wandering all over the place trying to ''construct'' whatever it was that makes up the alien. It is unsettling and perhaps unnerving, but that''s what makes the shot. Good title too.</td>', 'A very evocative image. I enjoyed this as my eye was wandering all over the place trying to ''construct'' whatever it was that makes up the alien. It is unsettling and perhaps unnerving, but that''s what makes the shot. Good title too.', '2005-09-21 18:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
