(1728282, 232469, 40371, '<td valign="top">I think this would be so much better with out the buildings in the background.  You should have just had that cool sky instead.</td>', 'I think this would be so much better with out the buildings in the background.  You should have just had that cool sky instead.', '2005-09-21 18:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728293, 234124, 21183, '<td valign="top">Darn, I spent ages commenting on this and then got logged out - but will try to rewrite:  I like the image and think it fits the challenge. The title is good and those eyes do look like bubbles. If this photo were mine I would try to capture so that the eyes were placed less closely to the frame and more to the left, so that they featured more as a point of focus - at the moment the wings seem to be the focus of attention. The surface that the insect sits on appears to slope and might benefit from levelling up in the photo manipulation software you use.  I like the background which doesn''t detract from the insect. I''ve scored this a 4, but feel that this particular image could be improved with a few careful manipulations which would turn it into a ''wow'' photo.  Best of luck with this in the challenge.</td>', 'Darn, I spent ages commenting on this and then got logged out - but will try to rewrite:  I like the image and think it fits the challenge. The title is good and those eyes do look like bubbles. If this photo were mine I would try to capture so that the eyes were placed less closely to the frame and more to the left, so that they featured more as a point of focus - at the moment the wings seem to be the focus of attention. The surface that the insect sits on appears to slope and might benefit from levelling up in the photo manipulation software you use.  I like the background which doesn''t detract from the insect. I''ve scored this a 4, but feel that this particular image could be improved with a few careful manipulations which would turn it into a ''wow'' photo.  Best of luck with this in the challenge.', '2005-09-21 18:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728303, 233892, 20530, '<td valign="top">Even with the title, this doesn''t say "Bubbles" to me. On the other hand, it''s not too bad for a live music photo. However, the composition is sort of strange, with the drumset being the center of attention.</td>', 'Even with the title, this doesn''t say "Bubbles" to me. On the other hand, it''s not too bad for a live music photo. However, the composition is sort of strange, with the drumset being the center of attention.', '2005-09-21 18:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728313, 231949, 20530, '<td valign="top">I know water droplets are sort of "bubblish", but it doesn''t really strike me as a " bubbles" image. I do like the composition and coloration, though the background seems a little noisy to me. The DOF seems to focus on a few drops just front of center; but it''s not quite enough to hold my interest.</td>', 'I know water droplets are sort of "bubblish", but it doesn''t really strike me as a " bubbles" image. I do like the composition and coloration, though the background seems a little noisy to me. The DOF seems to focus on a few drops just front of center; but it''s not quite enough to hold my interest.', '2005-09-21 18:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728330, 233371, 20530, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, and I marvel at your ability to make such a giant bubble!  Beyond that, this image doesn''t do a lot for me. The walls and door are not especially attractive. The lighting and colors are not so great, and detail is lost in dark areas. Bubble is out of focus. Compositionally nitpicking: The light switch, or whatever, on middle right edge might have been cropped off. Don''t worry, you still kicked my butt!</td>', 'I like the concept, and I marvel at your ability to make such a giant bubble!  Beyond that, this image doesn''t do a lot for me. The walls and door are not especially attractive. The lighting and colors are not so great, and detail is lost in dark areas. Bubble is out of focus. Compositionally nitpicking: The light switch, or whatever, on middle right edge might have been cropped off. Don''t worry, you still kicked my butt!', '2005-09-21 18:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1728344, 234308, 20530, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this is. Something blowing bubbles on a paper towel with a corrugated cardboard background?The purple bubble thing is kind of interesting; and you might try focusing on it while eliminating the distracting background and foreground elements. JMHO.</td>', 'I''m not sure what this is. Something blowing bubbles on a paper towel with a corrugated cardboard background?The purple bubble thing is kind of interesting; and you might try focusing on it while eliminating the distracting background and foreground elements. JMHO.', '2005-09-21 18:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
