(1728969, 234069, 20530, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This is awesome. I think I like the blade of grass intersecting the sun. The colors and tonality are great. The only (minor) detriment IMO is the black spot in the background above bubble.</td>', 'Wow.  This is awesome. I think I like the blade of grass intersecting the sun. The colors and tonality are great. The only (minor) detriment IMO is the black spot in the background above bubble.', '2005-09-21 22:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
