(1728998, 233943, 20530, '<td valign="top">I don''t doubt that it''s a bubble. It''s just so abstract, and dark that it doesn''t do a whole lot for me. It''s an interesting technique, though; and I''m thinking you could do some really cool stuff with this idea. Also, you can make your entries bigger. Wasn''t sure if you knew that. Don''t give up...I''m thinking it will do better than mine!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-28 12:43:19.</i></td>', 'I don''t doubt that it''s a bubble. It''s just so abstract, and dark that it doesn''t do a whole lot for me. It''s an interesting technique, though; and I''m thinking you could do some really cool stuff with this idea. Also, you can make your entries bigger. Wasn''t sure if you knew that. Don''t give up...I''m thinking it will do better than mine!', '2005-09-21 22:35:07.000000', '2005-09-28 13:43:19.000000', 1),
