(1730501, 234367, 31403, '<td valign="top">I think the voters won''t get this - but if that were a famous person this could be in a Maxim or a GQ or other high end mag.  I really like it.  The one thing I would change is more bubbles in the water to cover that grey water - but the grey water is part of what makes it look like a fashion photo to me.<br/> <br/>So if you meant to copy one of those overpaid highly sought after photographers, you did it!  If not, go look at those magazines next time you''re at the store!  You did it!<br/> <br/>Disclaimer:  I don''t subscribe or even really like those magazines, I simply look at them as a way to learn what photographers are doing in a wide range of styles.  :-)</td>', 'I think the voters won''t get this - but if that were a famous person this could be in a Maxim or a GQ or other high end mag.  I really like it.  The one thing I would change is more bubbles in the water to cover that grey water - but the grey water is part of what makes it look like a fashion photo to me. So if you meant to copy one of those overpaid highly sought after photographers, you did it!  If not, go look at those magazines next time you''re at the store!  You did it! Disclaimer:  I don''t subscribe or even really like those magazines, I simply look at them as a way to learn what photographers are doing in a wide range of styles.  :-)', '2005-09-22 11:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1730506, 234481, 31403, '<td valign="top">oh this is cool.  I love the hair band and the B&amp;W - makes it feel vintage.  I would love it more if the background was darker so the hands and bubbles drew my attention immediately.  If she was wearing something darker, or if you burned the background to darken it might work too.  Very nice.  7</td>', 'oh this is cool.  I love the hair band and the B&W - makes it feel vintage.  I would love it more if the background was darker so the hands and bubbles drew my attention immediately.  If she was wearing something darker, or if you burned the background to darken it might work too.  Very nice.  7', '2005-09-22 11:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1730508, 233768, 31403, '<td valign="top">"sharp" bubbles are cool, nice work</td>', '"sharp" bubbles are cool, nice work', '2005-09-22 11:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1730516, 234276, 31403, '<td valign="top">great focus and DOF through the shot, love the sharpness.  The colors are kind of unappetizing for me, would be better in B&amp;W IMO.  Did you take more than one photo of this?  I would like to see more exploration of the various compositions possible.  Off the top of my head, I''m wondering if you dug a hole so you could get your camera on the same level, or below the level of these shells?  To me the magic of photography is we can show stuff from different perspectives - so there''s some creative, off the top of my head rambling - hope it''s helpful  :-)</td>', 'great focus and DOF through the shot, love the sharpness.  The colors are kind of unappetizing for me, would be better in B&W IMO.  Did you take more than one photo of this?  I would like to see more exploration of the various compositions possible.  Off the top of my head, I''m wondering if you dug a hole so you could get your camera on the same level, or below the level of these shells?  To me the magic of photography is we can show stuff from different perspectives - so there''s some creative, off the top of my head rambling - hope it''s helpful  :-)', '2005-09-22 12:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1730523, 234540, 31403, '<td valign="top">do you have enough zoom or resolution to crop right down to the "interesting" bubble?  That frozen motion is VERY unique and I would love to see just that in the photo, maybe off to one side on the "third line" nice capture and unique take on the challenge.</td>', 'do you have enough zoom or resolution to crop right down to the "interesting" bubble?  That frozen motion is VERY unique and I would love to see just that in the photo, maybe off to one side on the "third line" nice capture and unique take on the challenge.', '2005-09-22 12:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1730526, 233785, 31403, '<td valign="top">focus is a little soft, and the DOF is really narrow here.  I''d also crop it down - the table/counter top doesn''t add anything to the composition - this is one I''d like to see in color to, I love the rich browns this type of scene has.  Great idea</td>', 'focus is a little soft, and the DOF is really narrow here.  I''d also crop it down - the table/counter top doesn''t add anything to the composition - this is one I''d like to see in color to, I love the rich browns this type of scene has.  Great idea', '2005-09-22 12:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1730531, 234584, 31403, '<td valign="top">very pretty, I find myself wondering if it''s bubbles that makes white water white - or reflections.  What a sillty thing to wonder about such a beautiful photo.  I like it and I don''t care what makes it white!  :-)  8</td>', 'very pretty, I find myself wondering if it''s bubbles that makes white water white - or reflections.  What a sillty thing to wonder about such a beautiful photo.  I like it and I don''t care what makes it white!  :-)  8', '2005-09-22 12:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1730534, 233804, 31403, '<td valign="top">this shot has potential in some kind of natural light, but an onboard flash within feet of a subject is never going to give you a pleasing result (the black line around her chin, the way it "flattens" her face).  Once you''re in more natural, or diffuse light, try turning her a little so you''re not so straight on to her nose.  I hope you had fun goofing off and getting the shot - it looks like the kind of thing that you would laugh a lot on - 2</td>', 'this shot has potential in some kind of natural light, but an onboard flash within feet of a subject is never going to give you a pleasing result (the black line around her chin, the way it "flattens" her face).  Once you''re in more natural, or diffuse light, try turning her a little so you''re not so straight on to her nose.  I hope you had fun goofing off and getting the shot - it looks like the kind of thing that you would laugh a lot on - 2', '2005-09-22 12:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1730547, 232834, 31403, '<td valign="top">if this were a visual scavenger hunt, you would win!  Those are huge bubbles.  But the subject "blasted" with light from your onboard flash, but not enough light to light the bubbles, the straight on angle, and the visually cluttered background make this feel like a snapshot.  Snapshots will always score low.  <br/> <br/>Don''t be discouraged by my comments or your low score.  Look at what wins on this site and try to replicate it - it''s what I''m trying to do, and I''m learning tons.  I hope my comments help.</td>', 'if this were a visual scavenger hunt, you would win!  Those are huge bubbles.  But the subject "blasted" with light from your onboard flash, but not enough light to light the bubbles, the straight on angle, and the visually cluttered background make this feel like a snapshot.  Snapshots will always score low.   Don''t be discouraged by my comments or your low score.  Look at what wins on this site and try to replicate it - it''s what I''m trying to do, and I''m learning tons.  I hope my comments help.', '2005-09-22 12:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
