(1730618, 231928, 31606, '<td valign="top">I am sorry but the image is too small you might want to check out the tutorial here about sizing your images for challenges.  It is found here:<br/>//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26<br/> <br/>If it was bigger I could give a better critique on it.</td>', 'I am sorry but the image is too small you might want to check out the tutorial here about sizing your images for challenges.  It is found here://www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26 If it was bigger I could give a better critique on it.', '2005-09-22 13:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
