(1730646, 234481, 43463, '<td valign="top">This shot has some potential - we see the bubbles but there is something that is lacking from this photo and that is the introduction of the human element in response to those bubbles. We see a child here in this shot - the child is not the focal point but he/she should have been brought in as a focal point in addition to the bubbles shown adorning the hands. This would be so much more visually appealing if we could see an expression on the child''s face - and expression of wonder, a smile, a laugh - it would go a long way into improving this composition.</td>', 'This shot has some potential - we see the bubbles but there is something that is lacking from this photo and that is the introduction of the human element in response to those bubbles. We see a child here in this shot - the child is not the focal point but he/she should have been brought in as a focal point in addition to the bubbles shown adorning the hands. This would be so much more visually appealing if we could see an expression on the child''s face - and expression of wonder, a smile, a laugh - it would go a long way into improving this composition.', '2005-09-22 13:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
