(1730682, 234544, 43463, '<td valign="top">A good capture of some bubbles in this shot, but the addition of too much sky or rather so much clouds in the sky make this scene rather too busy that the attention to the bubbles is lost within the clouds. Keeping the scene simple as in a mostly blue or all blue sky with the bubbles being dominent in the scene (and by that I mean that the frame is 50% or above full of the bubbles) would help in keeping our attention focused on the main subject of the shot.</td>', 'A good capture of some bubbles in this shot, but the addition of too much sky or rather so much clouds in the sky make this scene rather too busy that the attention to the bubbles is lost within the clouds. Keeping the scene simple as in a mostly blue or all blue sky with the bubbles being dominent in the scene (and by that I mean that the frame is 50% or above full of the bubbles) would help in keeping our attention focused on the main subject of the shot.', '2005-09-22 13:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
