(1731214, 234343, 31403, '<td valign="top">that''s a good way to get your milk taken away at our house!  Great framing and composition make this a lot of fun.  if the lighting were more balance - no, the background is too close - hmmm - there''s something in that realm that isn''t making my socks go up and down - wish I could put my finger on it for you.  Great photo though - 6</td>', 'that''s a good way to get your milk taken away at our house!  Great framing and composition make this a lot of fun.  if the lighting were more balance - no, the background is too close - hmmm - there''s something in that realm that isn''t making my socks go up and down - wish I could put my finger on it for you.  Great photo though - 6', '2005-09-22 17:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
