(1733556, 233866, 27482, '<td valign="top">I gave you a pretty low rating and the reason for that is that I personally don´t see how this ties in with the challenge theme as I don´t see anything even resembling a bubble in the whole photo and I looked carefully.  On top of that I don´t find the photo flattering at all as I strongly dislike blown out highlights and lens flare.  Just wanted to explain why I gave it a 2.</td>', 'I gave you a pretty low rating and the reason for that is that I personally don´t see how this ties in with the challenge theme as I don´t see anything even resembling a bubble in the whole photo and I looked carefully.  On top of that I don´t find the photo flattering at all as I strongly dislike blown out highlights and lens flare.  Just wanted to explain why I gave it a 2.', '2005-09-23 13:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
