(1734859, 233412, 42984, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty amazinf really.  The colours and the depth and the construction are amazing so it''s a shame to say that it''s not a "power" image because you forgot the rule of thirds.  I know that''s the other challenge but the rule applies to all images that have impact. All this needs is the sun moved onto either the left or right vertical lines.  Stuff in the centre for some reason just doesn''t work.</td>', 'That''s pretty amazinf really.  The colours and the depth and the construction are amazing so it''s a shame to say that it''s not a "power" image because you forgot the rule of thirds.  I know that''s the other challenge but the rule applies to all images that have impact. All this needs is the sun moved onto either the left or right vertical lines.  Stuff in the centre for some reason just doesn''t work.', '2005-09-24 00:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
