(1735649, 234631, 30881, '<td valign="top">Glad you kept background well blurred and I like the branches redirecting my eye back to the bubble(subject) Lighting and reflections on bubble work very well. Its hard to get a bubble to keep a viewers attention but with the reflections and small buds on branches it does accomplish this reasonably well Good job!!</td>', 'Glad you kept background well blurred and I like the branches redirecting my eye back to the bubble(subject) Lighting and reflections on bubble work very well. Its hard to get a bubble to keep a viewers attention but with the reflections and small buds on branches it does accomplish this reasonably well Good job!!', '2005-09-24 12:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735652, 231586, 30881, '<td valign="top">Shows great imagination and nice out of the box thinking and style "Modernistic surrealism" immediately comes to mind Great stuff! "10"</td>', 'Shows great imagination and nice out of the box thinking and style "Modernistic surrealism" immediately comes to mind Great stuff! "10"', '2005-09-24 12:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735655, 232933, 28710, '<td valign="top">Hey! Didn''t have time to vote on this challenge, but I''d still like to say GREAT picture. Nice idea. The boy has great eyes and great expression.<br/> <br/>FWIW, Zen masters typically use their chopsticks closer to the other end as a demonstration of control, but your technique isn''t bad :). <br/> <br/>There is actually a whole set of superstitions about where you hold the chopsticks comfortably. They are pretty typically nonsense, but one says that the closer you hold to the end, the older you will be when you marry!</td>', 'Hey! Didn''t have time to vote on this challenge, but I''d still like to say GREAT picture. Nice idea. The boy has great eyes and great expression. FWIW, Zen masters typically use their chopsticks closer to the other end as a demonstration of control, but your technique isn''t bad :).  There is actually a whole set of superstitions about where you hold the chopsticks comfortably. They are pretty typically nonsense, but one says that the closer you hold to the end, the older you will be when you marry!', '2005-09-24 12:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1735663, 232174, 30881, '<td valign="top">As a Canadian its nice to see one of our beers promoted,  too bad you didn''t pick one with much better taste. lol Good layout but would have liked to see themug much sharper. The background is stealing the show unfortunately</td>', 'As a Canadian its nice to see one of our beers promoted,  too bad you didn''t pick one with much better taste. lol Good layout but would have liked to see themug much sharper. The background is stealing the show unfortunately', '2005-09-24 12:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
