(1737028, 233374, 8624, '<td valign="top">this is what all the other snapshots of kids blowing bubbles should have been. you framed the image very well, effective used depth of field and have an interesting bubble shape captured.</td>', 'this is what all the other snapshots of kids blowing bubbles should have been. you framed the image very well, effective used depth of field and have an interesting bubble shape captured.', '2005-09-25 09:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737032, 232754, 8624, '<td valign="top">pretty funny. great expression. there were nay other images like this in the challenge, kinda poorly composed with crappy lighting, but this one is better on some level. The bubble is well composed and his big surprised eyes made me laugh.</td>', 'pretty funny. great expression. there were nay other images like this in the challenge, kinda poorly composed with crappy lighting, but this one is better on some level. The bubble is well composed and his big surprised eyes made me laugh.', '2005-09-25 09:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737034, 233959, 8624, '<td valign="top">great colors!</td>', 'great colors!', '2005-09-25 09:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737039, 232288, 8624, '<td valign="top">my favorite in the challenge. great light and composition. I love the contrats in the size of the bubbles</td>', 'my favorite in the challenge. great light and composition. I love the contrats in the size of the bubbles', '2005-09-25 09:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737042, 233050, 8624, '<td valign="top">one of my 3 favorites in the challenge. you certainly captured the light airy feeling of a ballerina''s dance. I assume this is upside down?</td>', 'one of my 3 favorites in the challenge. you certainly captured the light airy feeling of a ballerina''s dance. I assume this is upside down?', '2005-09-25 10:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737060, 234613, 4477, '<td valign="top">Neat image!  I also like how you used the boxed in border.  Great highlights too.</td>', 'Neat image!  I also like how you used the boxed in border.  Great highlights too.', '2005-09-25 10:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737061, 234367, 4477, '<td valign="top">New meaning for the word "bubble bath" huh?  :-)  Creative.</td>', 'New meaning for the word "bubble bath" huh?  :-)  Creative.', '2005-09-25 10:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737062, 234481, 4477, '<td valign="top">Good DOF.  Makes this image work.</td>', 'Good DOF.  Makes this image work.', '2005-09-25 10:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737063, 232005, 4477, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  Maybe if it were more centered, it would be a bit more powerful of an image.  Great lighting though and I really like your choice of colors.</td>', 'I like the idea.  Maybe if it were more centered, it would be a bit more powerful of an image.  Great lighting though and I really like your choice of colors.', '2005-09-25 10:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737064, 233406, 4477, '<td valign="top">Seems very calming, because of the colors.  Good composition too.</td>', 'Seems very calming, because of the colors.  Good composition too.', '2005-09-25 10:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737067, 233841, 4477, '<td valign="top">Very neat!  Reminds me of the yin and yang symbol.</td>', 'Very neat!  Reminds me of the yin and yang symbol.', '2005-09-25 10:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737081, 234069, 43672, '<td valign="top">nice photo, however I find the bird in the upper right corner distracting :)</td>', 'nice photo, however I find the bird in the upper right corner distracting :)', '2005-09-25 10:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737117, 231593, 40679, '<td valign="top">I''ve been looking at the reflection for a while now, but I can''t figure it out. It truly holds my attention!</td>', 'I''ve been looking at the reflection for a while now, but I can''t figure it out. It truly holds my attention!', '2005-09-25 11:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737118, 231586, 40679, '<td valign="top">the colors are stunning!! well done!</td>', 'the colors are stunning!! well done!', '2005-09-25 11:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737119, 231849, 40679, '<td valign="top">not sure if this is a bubble, but I do like the effect.</td>', 'not sure if this is a bubble, but I do like the effect.', '2005-09-25 11:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737120, 234461, 40679, '<td valign="top">makes me smile :)</td>', 'makes me smile :)', '2005-09-25 11:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737121, 234462, 40679, '<td valign="top">sadly the tail isn''t complete on the picture.</td>', 'sadly the tail isn''t complete on the picture.', '2005-09-25 11:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737123, 233902, 40679, '<td valign="top">I tried something like this, but my own result was crappy. well done!</td>', 'I tried something like this, but my own result was crappy. well done!', '2005-09-25 11:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737124, 234276, 40679, '<td valign="top">nice detail!</td>', 'nice detail!', '2005-09-25 11:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737125, 233381, 40679, '<td valign="top">very abstract. I like it</td>', 'very abstract. I like it', '2005-09-25 11:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737126, 234565, 40679, '<td valign="top">what is it I''m looking at?</td>', 'what is it I''m looking at?', '2005-09-25 11:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737127, 232288, 40679, '<td valign="top">perfect detail. I''d place the border outside the center to keep the rule of thirds in it.</td>', 'perfect detail. I''d place the border outside the center to keep the rule of thirds in it.', '2005-09-25 11:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737128, 233108, 40679, '<td valign="top">I think sepia would work better here. very cool though!</td>', 'I think sepia would work better here. very cool though!', '2005-09-25 11:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737129, 234470, 40679, '<td valign="top">keep her safe ;)</td>', 'keep her safe ;)', '2005-09-25 11:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737130, 234613, 40679, '<td valign="top">I like the colors</td>', 'I like the colors', '2005-09-25 11:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737131, 232077, 40679, '<td valign="top">what happened to her eyes?</td>', 'what happened to her eyes?', '2005-09-25 11:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737134, 234579, 40679, '<td valign="top">those eyes! brilliant!</td>', 'those eyes! brilliant!', '2005-09-25 11:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737135, 233046, 40679, '<td valign="top">I love the look of the little girl. nice</td>', 'I love the look of the little girl. nice', '2005-09-25 11:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737136, 232243, 40679, '<td valign="top">next time I''d place a larger photo if I were you ;-)</td>', 'next time I''d place a larger photo if I were you ;-)', '2005-09-25 11:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737139, 232803, 40679, '<td valign="top">this is something else ;-) nice focus!</td>', 'this is something else ;-) nice focus!', '2005-09-25 11:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737140, 234360, 40679, '<td valign="top">very good DoF</td>', 'very good DoF', '2005-09-25 11:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737141, 233050, 40679, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! I used to play ballet when I was a little girl, thank you for bringing back my memories :) I love the picture too, by the way</td>', 'Gorgeous! I used to play ballet when I was a little girl, thank you for bringing back my memories :) I love the picture too, by the way', '2005-09-25 11:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737144, 234584, 40679, '<td valign="top">I love long exposures like this.. but can''t find any bubbles :-(</td>', 'I love long exposures like this.. but can''t find any bubbles :-(', '2005-09-25 11:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737146, 231472, 40679, '<td valign="top">This really keeps my attention. Great!</td>', 'This really keeps my attention. Great!', '2005-09-25 11:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737147, 233907, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great color and the simplicity of the composition is nice.  There is a hot spot in the yellow on the left which is a bit distracting.  Certainly bubbles so it meets the challenge and the contrasts shown are interesting.  I gave a 5.</td>', 'Great color and the simplicity of the composition is nice.  There is a hot spot in the yellow on the left which is a bit distracting.  Certainly bubbles so it meets the challenge and the contrasts shown are interesting.  I gave a 5.', '2005-09-25 11:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737148, 232869, 40679, '<td valign="top">Cool detail. great job!</td>', 'Cool detail. great job!', '2005-09-25 11:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737151, 232570, 40679, '<td valign="top">wow, love the colors! nice shadows</td>', 'wow, love the colors! nice shadows', '2005-09-25 11:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737152, 234615, 40679, '<td valign="top">so sweeet!</td>', 'so sweeet!', '2005-09-25 11:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737155, 234099, 40679, '<td valign="top">very minimalistic, truly a favorite!</td>', 'very minimalistic, truly a favorite!', '2005-09-25 11:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737156, 234579, 11923, '<td valign="top">Hm.  It meets the challenge, obviously.  Great clarity and focus.  Lighting looks good, but I''m not sure about the composition.  I can''t tell if it has an unnatural flatness emotionally because of the lack of color or not - I''m just not being drawn into this image.  Maybe its because only the child''s eyes are showing and they look almost angry the way the eyebrows are set, perhaps if the whole face was showing and you could see if he were smiling or not that might bring a lighter emotion into it for me.  All in all I gave a 5.</td>', 'Hm.  It meets the challenge, obviously.  Great clarity and focus.  Lighting looks good, but I''m not sure about the composition.  I can''t tell if it has an unnatural flatness emotionally because of the lack of color or not - I''m just not being drawn into this image.  Maybe its because only the child''s eyes are showing and they look almost angry the way the eyebrows are set, perhaps if the whole face was showing and you could see if he were smiling or not that might bring a lighter emotion into it for me.  All in all I gave a 5.', '2005-09-25 11:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737158, 234544, 40679, '<td valign="top">this keeps my attention, from the bottom center to the left to the upper right corner</td>', 'this keeps my attention, from the bottom center to the left to the upper right corner', '2005-09-25 11:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737159, 231727, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very nice color!  I like how everything looks suspended and floating.  I also like how you can see the other bubbles reflected in the ones in the foreground.  There''s something a little hazy about the focus though that''s throwing me off a bit.  I do not know if its due to compression or a softer focus out of the camera.  I do like the metallic sheen that is shown though.  I gave a 6.</td>', 'Very nice color!  I like how everything looks suspended and floating.  I also like how you can see the other bubbles reflected in the ones in the foreground.  There''s something a little hazy about the focus though that''s throwing me off a bit.  I do not know if its due to compression or a softer focus out of the camera.  I do like the metallic sheen that is shown though.  I gave a 6.', '2005-09-25 11:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737160, 231848, 40679, '<td valign="top">I still do this with chocolatemilk :D</td>', 'I still do this with chocolatemilk :D', '2005-09-25 11:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737162, 232279, 40679, '<td valign="top">too bad there are no bubbles... :-(</td>', 'too bad there are no bubbles... :-(', '2005-09-25 11:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737163, 233391, 40679, '<td valign="top">these are bubbles? wauw!</td>', 'these are bubbles? wauw!', '2005-09-25 11:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737165, 234029, 40679, '<td valign="top">this one keeps my attention. I think I''d like it better if it was in color.</td>', 'this one keeps my attention. I think I''d like it better if it was in color.', '2005-09-25 11:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737166, 231728, 11923, '<td valign="top">I could''ve sworn I already voted and commented on this.. must not have gone through.  Alright.. I like the contrasts, the way the light has been used to make the loops, I like the bluish color tones as well.  The focus looks a bit off on the flower and its very difficult to discern the bubble due to the darker nature of the image.  I don''t know if this is to obscure that it is a glass bowl of some sort or some other reason.  Either way it meets the challenge but I wish I could see just a bit more of the "bubble" since that should be the focus of the image. I''m also not sure if I like the straight on composition, maybe something shifted to a corner so there was more negative space.. hard to say with the tones if that wouldn''t wipe out more details or not.  Overall I gave a 6.</td>', 'I could''ve sworn I already voted and commented on this.. must not have gone through.  Alright.. I like the contrasts, the way the light has been used to make the loops, I like the bluish color tones as well.  The focus looks a bit off on the flower and its very difficult to discern the bubble due to the darker nature of the image.  I don''t know if this is to obscure that it is a glass bowl of some sort or some other reason.  Either way it meets the challenge but I wish I could see just a bit more of the "bubble" since that should be the focus of the image. I''m also not sure if I like the straight on composition, maybe something shifted to a corner so there was more negative space.. hard to say with the tones if that wouldn''t wipe out more details or not.  Overall I gave a 6.', '2005-09-25 11:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737169, 234426, 40679, '<td valign="top">Is this a picture of your own?</td>', 'Is this a picture of your own?', '2005-09-25 11:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737172, 232933, 11923, '<td valign="top">"Beginna Luck" - Mr. Myagi.   Seriously, I really like this image.  Nice clarity, and lighting.  I like the play of the shadows obscuring part of the face and the clothes blending into the background.  The composition is good but I would''ve preferred that most of the focus be on the chopsticks holding the bubble, instead of the model''s face.  Right now the bubble seems incidental instead of central.  There is some soft focus on the arm that is a bit distracting and I''d like for the entire chopstick to be in the image instead of cut off at the end.  Overall I gave a 6.</td>', '"Beginna Luck" - Mr. Myagi.   Seriously, I really like this image.  Nice clarity, and lighting.  I like the play of the shadows obscuring part of the face and the clothes blending into the background.  The composition is good but I would''ve preferred that most of the focus be on the chopsticks holding the bubble, instead of the model''s face.  Right now the bubble seems incidental instead of central.  There is some soft focus on the arm that is a bit distracting and I''d like for the entire chopstick to be in the image instead of cut off at the end.  Overall I gave a 6.', '2005-09-25 11:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737178, 233849, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and lovely clarity with the fruit/veg and bubble.  Is this fruit/veg in ice held up?  If so it certainly gives a very nice crispness and lets light diffuse very well.  I love the clean feeling of the image.  Focus is good, lighting is great, composition is interesting.  If I''d change one thing I''d do something to give the sky just a bit more color interest, right now it seems a bit TOO bland compared to how vibrant the fruit/vegetables look, the shiny nature of the "bubble" almost highlights how dull the color of the sky is.  Still a wonderfully interesting shot.  I gave a 7.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and lovely clarity with the fruit/veg and bubble.  Is this fruit/veg in ice held up?  If so it certainly gives a very nice crispness and lets light diffuse very well.  I love the clean feeling of the image.  Focus is good, lighting is great, composition is interesting.  If I''d change one thing I''d do something to give the sky just a bit more color interest, right now it seems a bit TOO bland compared to how vibrant the fruit/vegetables look, the shiny nature of the "bubble" almost highlights how dull the color of the sky is.  Still a wonderfully interesting shot.  I gave a 7.', '2005-09-25 11:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737184, 234400, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the bubbles, I wish the ones that had the fantastic focus were a little more prominent instead of tucked in the background of the photo.  The lighting is spot on and there is nice color contrasts.  That said, though I find the bubbles themselves interesting due to their sparkle, the rest of the photograph''s elements do not grab me at all and I find myself losing interest quickly.  Perhaps if there was a way to isolate that one leaf with those perfect balls/bubbles of water so the focus could be on there, it would up the interest and wow factor by a lot.  I gave a 4</td>', 'I like the bubbles, I wish the ones that had the fantastic focus were a little more prominent instead of tucked in the background of the photo.  The lighting is spot on and there is nice color contrasts.  That said, though I find the bubbles themselves interesting due to their sparkle, the rest of the photograph''s elements do not grab me at all and I find myself losing interest quickly.  Perhaps if there was a way to isolate that one leaf with those perfect balls/bubbles of water so the focus could be on there, it would up the interest and wow factor by a lot.  I gave a 4', '2005-09-25 11:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737188, 234062, 11923, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge and has some interesting colors but other than that the image does not inspire any emotion or interest in me.  Some may not appreciate the sort of rougher look to the image, but I think its fine, whether it was intentional or not.  I''m not too fond of the hot whites throughout the image though.  Over all the image just doesn''t have enough elements to interest me.  I gave a 4.</td>', 'Meets the challenge and has some interesting colors but other than that the image does not inspire any emotion or interest in me.  Some may not appreciate the sort of rougher look to the image, but I think its fine, whether it was intentional or not.  I''m not too fond of the hot whites throughout the image though.  Over all the image just doesn''t have enough elements to interest me.  I gave a 4.', '2005-09-25 12:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737190, 234467, 41554, '<td valign="top">Far too much OOF. Sorry...</td>', 'Far too much OOF. Sorry...', '2005-09-25 12:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737194, 234623, 11923, '<td valign="top">There are certainly bubbles and so it meets the challenge, the focus is also great.  Use of natural light is okay.. I''d suggest some kind of additional light source to help highlight what should be the focus of the image, the bubbles.. unless you were going for the verb usage of bubble in which the water bubbling out of the top is in focus so that would work.  I find the composition a bit lax, the main image is cut off and the unfocus rim right at the foreground of the photograph is very distracting.  The title references a sunset but the colors are very washed out and also in the soft focused background due to the portraitish nature of the image.  Since the sunset has been called to attention by the title, I think its effects should be more visible.. maybe more rays of colored sun playing over the water something like that.  I think it was a good idea, but there are some things that need altering to give it more pop.  I gave a 5.</td>', 'There are certainly bubbles and so it meets the challenge, the focus is also great.  Use of natural light is okay.. I''d suggest some kind of additional light source to help highlight what should be the focus of the image, the bubbles.. unless you were going for the verb usage of bubble in which the water bubbling out of the top is in focus so that would work.  I find the composition a bit lax, the main image is cut off and the unfocus rim right at the foreground of the photograph is very distracting.  The title references a sunset but the colors are very washed out and also in the soft focused background due to the portraitish nature of the image.  Since the sunset has been called to attention by the title, I think its effects should be more visible.. maybe more rays of colored sun playing over the water something like that.  I think it was a good idea, but there are some things that need altering to give it more pop.  I gave a 5.', '2005-09-25 12:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737199, 231978, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love the bubbles!  Great use of light and there''s a very nice feeling of weightlessness and floating.  The color is very nice.  The composition is good but.. all of the out of focus bubbles seem to impact the image much more than the in focuse bubbles, drawing my eyes downward.  I had a similar problem with my image and thought keeping some out of focus items would give a nice contrast  but intsead it just seems distracting as they are here.  The only other area that seems a bit off is the very hot white/blue up in the right hand corner.  I gave a 6.</td>', 'I love the bubbles!  Great use of light and there''s a very nice feeling of weightlessness and floating.  The color is very nice.  The composition is good but.. all of the out of focus bubbles seem to impact the image much more than the in focuse bubbles, drawing my eyes downward.  I had a similar problem with my image and thought keeping some out of focus items would give a nice contrast  but intsead it just seems distracting as they are here.  The only other area that seems a bit off is the very hot white/blue up in the right hand corner.  I gave a 6.', '2005-09-25 12:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737204, 234504, 11923, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  Meets the challenge and has two potentially great subjects.  The composition is a bit off to me.  Perhaps if you''d used the bubble like a lens so we could only see the tree through the bubble, that''d add another layer of interest.  Also the focus is just not there..  Looks as though you were moving when the image was taken?  Perhaps this is intentional but I don''t think it does the image justice.  The use of natural light is okay, its a little hard to tell since many of the details are blurred out.  I like the idea behind it, I like the execution in general but the technical aspects are lacking.  I think the border is a bit too much for this image too, nearly dominates.  I gave a 4.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  Meets the challenge and has two potentially great subjects.  The composition is a bit off to me.  Perhaps if you''d used the bubble like a lens so we could only see the tree through the bubble, that''d add another layer of interest.  Also the focus is just not there..  Looks as though you were moving when the image was taken?  Perhaps this is intentional but I don''t think it does the image justice.  The use of natural light is okay, its a little hard to tell since many of the details are blurred out.  I like the idea behind it, I like the execution in general but the technical aspects are lacking.  I think the border is a bit too much for this image too, nearly dominates.  I gave a 4.', '2005-09-25 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737208, 234464, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice title!   I love the blue and the composition is okay.  The image is a bit flat in an inspiration sort of way, there''s no pop that might be there from a crisp, sharp focus.  The whole bottom section has lost some detail due to lack of focus, I would''ve probably cropped that out.  The light usage is good.  I think this could''ve been way better if a sharper focus was available.  I gave a 4</td>', 'Nice title!   I love the blue and the composition is okay.  The image is a bit flat in an inspiration sort of way, there''s no pop that might be there from a crisp, sharp focus.  The whole bottom section has lost some detail due to lack of focus, I would''ve probably cropped that out.  The light usage is good.  I think this could''ve been way better if a sharper focus was available.  I gave a 4', '2005-09-25 12:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737217, 232940, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love the neon color.  Bubbles are present, composition is interesting - nice use of negative space.  There is good focus, but it seems a bit soft on the outer edge of the glass, wish it was a little crisper throughout.  Overall a nice image.  I gave a 6</td>', 'I love the neon color.  Bubbles are present, composition is interesting - nice use of negative space.  There is good focus, but it seems a bit soft on the outer edge of the glass, wish it was a little crisper throughout.  Overall a nice image.  I gave a 6', '2005-09-25 12:20:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1737232, 234584, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I always like waterfall images such as this.  The focus and light usage is great.  The bubble aspect, not so much.  I realize that rushing water typically is chock full of bubbles but they have been smoothed into oblivion in this image.  There are also a few (very small) areas where it looks like the lens got droplets on it.  Tiny but once noticed they start to detract.  I can''t tell if this was taken specifically for this challenge or if it was sort of shoehorned in.  I wish some bubbles (in their bubbly form) were visible but that''s just me.  All the same, I gave a 6.</td>', 'Very pretty.  I always like waterfall images such as this.  The focus and light usage is great.  The bubble aspect, not so much.  I realize that rushing water typically is chock full of bubbles but they have been smoothed into oblivion in this image.  There are also a few (very small) areas where it looks like the lens got droplets on it.  Tiny but once noticed they start to detract.  I can''t tell if this was taken specifically for this challenge or if it was sort of shoehorned in.  I wish some bubbles (in their bubbly form) were visible but that''s just me.  All the same, I gave a 6.', '2005-09-25 12:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737237, 233904, 11923, '<td valign="top">Heh the elephant in the room sort of situation eh?.  Good focus, decent light, though it is a bit shadowed in the foreground.  It feels a bit snapshot-ish, but that could just be all the people milling about with no real purpose.  I like the interest the bubble itself brings, from the curvature of the buildings along the side and the reflected people.  Feels almost "Where''s Waldo"-like.  I also like the use of a different sort of bubble.  I gave a 5.</td>', 'Heh the elephant in the room sort of situation eh?.  Good focus, decent light, though it is a bit shadowed in the foreground.  It feels a bit snapshot-ish, but that could just be all the people milling about with no real purpose.  I like the interest the bubble itself brings, from the curvature of the buildings along the side and the reflected people.  Feels almost "Where''s Waldo"-like.  I also like the use of a different sort of bubble.  I gave a 5.', '2005-09-25 12:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737238, 231936, 35545, '<td valign="top">Needs to be in focus.</td>', 'Needs to be in focus.', '2005-09-25 12:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737240, 233785, 35545, '<td valign="top">Needs to be in focus.  The shadow and lack of focus doesn''t let us seek the bubbles very well.</td>', 'Needs to be in focus.  The shadow and lack of focus doesn''t let us seek the bubbles very well.', '2005-09-25 12:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737243, 232174, 35545, '<td valign="top">The background is tilted.  The out of focus strip on the bottom detracts from the image.</td>', 'The background is tilted.  The out of focus strip on the bottom detracts from the image.', '2005-09-25 12:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737244, 233959, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow, this has so many interesting features.  I love the contrast in color and materials.  The bubbles are perfect and interesting and the focus looks good.  I think this could have been SO much better though if there was just more light.  Enough to capture and let that orange color glow and get those bubbles glistening.  The dull nature of the lighting really lets this image down.  I gave a 5 for its potential and meeting the challenge but if the lighting were different and the whole image more vibrant I probably would''ve given a 7.</td>', 'Wow, this has so many interesting features.  I love the contrast in color and materials.  The bubbles are perfect and interesting and the focus looks good.  I think this could have been SO much better though if there was just more light.  Enough to capture and let that orange color glow and get those bubbles glistening.  The dull nature of the lighting really lets this image down.  I gave a 5 for its potential and meeting the challenge but if the lighting were different and the whole image more vibrant I probably would''ve given a 7.', '2005-09-25 12:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737247, 234505, 35545, '<td valign="top">Are the colord spots in the foreground the irridescence from bubbles?  Good idea, but I had to think too hard to figure it out.</td>', 'Are the colord spots in the foreground the irridescence from bubbles?  Good idea, but I had to think too hard to figure it out.', '2005-09-25 12:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737251, 232051, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very rich colors, interesting textures showing.  The lighting is good but the blown out white is a bit distracting.  I like the water droplet but I wish it was a bit closer to where all the interesting action is.. that mess of bubbly crunchy looking stuff at the bottom of the image.  Focus looks pretty good.  I gave a 6.</td>', 'Very rich colors, interesting textures showing.  The lighting is good but the blown out white is a bit distracting.  I like the water droplet but I wish it was a bit closer to where all the interesting action is.. that mess of bubbly crunchy looking stuff at the bottom of the image.  Focus looks pretty good.  I gave a 6.', '2005-09-25 12:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737254, 234615, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  The lighting is a little harsh for my eye, but maybe you needed that to bring out the bubbles.</td>', 'Good idea.  The lighting is a little harsh for my eye, but maybe you needed that to bring out the bubbles.', '2005-09-25 12:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737260, 233030, 35545, '<td valign="top">I''ll take your word for it that those are bubbles coming out of the radiator.  All I can see is a white drip.  This would have been good in the time capsule challenge.</td>', 'I''ll take your word for it that those are bubbles coming out of the radiator.  All I can see is a white drip.  This would have been good in the time capsule challenge.', '2005-09-25 12:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737270, 233903, 35545, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  I have no idea how you would control this, but I would have liked to have seen the bubble closer to the butterfly.  The bubble is so transparent that you almost miss it.  Also, I wish you comle have gotten rid of those dark leaves/branches which are out of focus.  Some people want everything!! I really think it''s a good concept and execution, but it needs some tweaking on the composition.</td>', 'Hmmm.  I have no idea how you would control this, but I would have liked to have seen the bubble closer to the butterfly.  The bubble is so transparent that you almost miss it.  Also, I wish you comle have gotten rid of those dark leaves/branches which are out of focus.  Some people want everything!! I really think it''s a good concept and execution, but it needs some tweaking on the composition.', '2005-09-25 12:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737272, 234400, 35545, '<td valign="top">Those look more like dew drops to me.  The out of focus blade of grass in the lower right really intrudes.</td>', 'Those look more like dew drops to me.  The out of focus blade of grass in the lower right really intrudes.', '2005-09-25 12:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1737275, 234624, 35545, '<td valign="top">Vulgar title.  I wish you hadn''t cut the top of the girl''s head off.  Nice skin tones, and she has a good expression in her eyes.</td>', 'Vulgar title.  I wish you hadn''t cut the top of the girl''s head off.  Nice skin tones, and she has a good expression in her eyes.', '2005-09-25 12:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
