(1744402, 233841, 40081, '<td valign="top">This is unexpected but really terrific: a 6+ and top 10%(I feel the pressure mounting wondering how to keep this up in the future :-) ).<br/>I was pleased with the bubble itself, but less so with the background and the reflection. There was no time left to shoot another one, so I submitted this picture hoping for a 5+.<br/>Thank you all for the nice and helpful remarks and for the great scoring.</td>', 'This is unexpected but really terrific: a 6+ and top 10%(I feel the pressure mounting wondering how to keep this up in the future :-) ).I was pleased with the bubble itself, but less so with the background and the reflection. There was no time left to shoot another one, so I submitted this picture hoping for a 5+.Thank you all for the nice and helpful remarks and for the great scoring.', '2005-09-28 04:18:34.000000', NULL, 0),
