(1744430, 234470, 34247, '<td valign="top">It works both as an image in itself, as well as a story. Its clever. It''s also creative, because its cleverness doesn''t hit you in the head, and is instead subtle and not obvious. Most importantly, it makes you think, and I''d take that kind of an image over the obviously pretty and clever any day. It''s eerie and comforting all at the same time.</td>', 'It works both as an image in itself, as well as a story. Its clever. It''s also creative, because its cleverness doesn''t hit you in the head, and is instead subtle and not obvious. Most importantly, it makes you think, and I''d take that kind of an image over the obviously pretty and clever any day. It''s eerie and comforting all at the same time.', '2005-09-28 04:43:15.000000', NULL, 0),
