(1744569, 233764, 7810, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon ... my fav for the challenge</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon ... my fav for the challenge', '2005-09-28 06:43:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1744594, 233789, 18450, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the critique club :-)<br/> <br/><b>Initial thoughts</b> <br/>Love the red shoes, they immediately made me think of ''The Wizard of Oz'' Creative idea and if there had been the focus on the bubble it would have been a great shot. <br/> <br/><b>Composition</b> <br/>Though I really like the composition of this shot I think I''d like to see the crop not quite so close. Her foot and leg pose are perfect and create lovely lines. The inclusion of the gingham dress edge adds to the ''Oz'' illusion and shows great attention to detail...good work!<br/> <br/><b>Camera work/technical</b> <br/>Lack of focus on the bubble is the biggest technical problem with this shot. Bubbles are incredibly difficult to focus on using the A/F, sometimes all you can do is set the camera to M/F, prefocus on where you hope the bubble will go and wait....and take lots of shots! It''s good to try different aperatures to find the look you want..higher f-stop with everything in focus, low f-stop with just the bubble full focus and the shoes slightly OOF. Experimenting like this gets you the image you can see in your mind. Image is only 76kb, you will find you get better image quality if you use the full 150kb you''re able to upload in the challenges.<br/> <br/><b>Digital processing</b> No comments from the photographer to go on. <br/> <br/><b>Fits the challenge</b> <br/>Definitely fits the challenge though would have received much higher score with the bubble focused. <br/> <br/><b>Personal opinion</b> <br/>I love the creativity and idea of this image, colours are great. Look forward to seeing more of your work in the future. <br/> <br/>sue<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-28 07:46:06.</i></td>', 'Greetings from the critique club :-) Initial thoughts Love the red shoes, they immediately made me think of ''The Wizard of Oz'' Creative idea and if there had been the focus on the bubble it would have been a great shot.  Composition Though I really like the composition of this shot I think I''d like to see the crop not quite so close. Her foot and leg pose are perfect and create lovely lines. The inclusion of the gingham dress edge adds to the ''Oz'' illusion and shows great attention to detail...good work! Camera work/technical Lack of focus on the bubble is the biggest technical problem with this shot. Bubbles are incredibly difficult to focus on using the A/F, sometimes all you can do is set the camera to M/F, prefocus on where you hope the bubble will go and wait....and take lots of shots! It''s good to try different aperatures to find the look you want..higher f-stop with everything in focus, low f-stop with just the bubble full focus and the shoes slightly OOF. Experimenting like this gets you the image you can see in your mind. Image is only 76kb, you will find you get better image quality if you use the full 150kb you''re able to upload in the challenges. Digital processing No comments from the photographer to go on.  Fits the challenge Definitely fits the challenge though would have received much higher score with the bubble focused.  Personal opinion I love the creativity and idea of this image, colours are great. Look forward to seeing more of your work in the future.  sue', '2005-09-28 07:19:43.000000', '2005-09-28 08:46:06.000000', 0),
(1744595, 233831, 44860, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Antanas:</b></div><hr/><i> I guess I know who''ll get the ribbon... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Aha! Love me - I''m Oracle!</td>', 'Originally posted by Antanas: I guess I know who''ll get the ribbon...   Aha! Love me - I''m Oracle!', '2005-09-28 07:19:55.000000', NULL, 0),
