(1745092, 231586, 17203, '<td valign="top">Great shot, Ursula! If I entered Bubbles, it would have been something like this (and you would have beaten me soundly). Don''t you just hate it when you score a 7.2 and it''s still not enough? :-(<br/> <br/>EDIT:  ...or a 7.41. ;-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-28 10:25:00.</i></td>', 'Great shot, Ursula! If I entered Bubbles, it would have been something like this (and you would have beaten me soundly). Don''t you just hate it when you score a 7.2 and it''s still not enough? :-( EDIT:  ...or a 7.41. ;-)', '2005-09-28 11:23:32.000000', '2005-09-28 11:25:00.000000', 0),
