(1745270, 233831, 25754, '<td valign="top">Thanks so much everyone for your comments and votes! It was a very tight race and I''m elated that I ended up Blue :D **happy dance**<br/> <br/>For those of you who pointed out the mouth/nose area, yeah... it''s just an unfortunate angle.. yeah, I''d do it again differently. Then again, maybe I wouldn''t.. I spent a ridiculous amount of time on this shot :)<br/> <br/>I was joking to friends this week that if I got a 4th ribbon I could retire from here very happily, and I might just do that for a while. It''s been fun and I''ve learned so much here!!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-29 00:13:25.</i></td>', 'Thanks so much everyone for your comments and votes! It was a very tight race and I''m elated that I ended up Blue :D **happy dance** For those of you who pointed out the mouth/nose area, yeah... it''s just an unfortunate angle.. yeah, I''d do it again differently. Then again, maybe I wouldn''t.. I spent a ridiculous amount of time on this shot :) I was joking to friends this week that if I got a 4th ribbon I could retire from here very happily, and I might just do that for a while. It''s been fun and I''ve learned so much here!!!', '2005-09-28 12:22:35.000000', '2005-09-29 01:13:25.000000', 0),
(1745282, 232933, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting, love the way the catchlights in the eyes are mirrored by the bubble.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting, love the way the catchlights in the eyes are mirrored by the bubble.', '2005-09-28 12:25:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1745324, 233402, 25754, '<td valign="top">This is adorable, congrats!</td>', 'This is adorable, congrats!', '2005-09-28 12:34:53.000000', NULL, 0),
