(1745849, 234379, 41960, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for good and helpful comments :D<br/> <br/>But i start to woner, What do you, all that rate my picture low, and start to say, "wish  the focus was on this plase and the focus is off" and so on! What do you think i am? i''m not a pro just so you know. This picture was taken on Canon ixus 40! Can you expect more from it? NO you can''t. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Thank you all for good and helpful comments :D But i start to woner, What do you, all that rate my picture low, and start to say, "wish  the focus was on this plase and the focus is off" and so on! What do you think i am? i''m not a pro just so you know. This picture was taken on Canon ixus 40! Can you expect more from it? NO you can''t.  ', '2005-09-28 15:59:26.000000', NULL, 0),
