(1746194, 234467, 42472, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the feedback...it''s always nice to get advice and opinions from those who know more about what they''re doing as opposed to looking at my own stuff. I was just happy not to come in dead last or be DQ''d -- especially since this is my first entry. I have had great luck with my 35mm SLR, but have had some difficulty adjusting to a digital. I have taken much better pictures with this camera, but find it difficult to actually SET UP a photo.  Thanks again for the feedback and advice...I''m still having fun learning about and playing with my camera and appreciate all the help I can get.</td>', 'Thanks for all the feedback...it''s always nice to get advice and opinions from those who know more about what they''re doing as opposed to looking at my own stuff. I was just happy not to come in dead last or be DQ''d -- especially since this is my first entry. I have had great luck with my 35mm SLR, but have had some difficulty adjusting to a digital. I have taken much better pictures with this camera, but find it difficult to actually SET UP a photo.  Thanks again for the feedback and advice...I''m still having fun learning about and playing with my camera and appreciate all the help I can get.', '2005-09-28 18:02:11.000000', NULL, 0),
