(1747177, 233831, 41522, '<td valign="top">This is unbelievable.  Fantastic work.  Very creative and technically so good.  I''m sure you are proud of this one, as you should be.  I can''t believe how many 1, 2 and 3 votes you got ... not sure what they were looking at?  Congrats!!!</td>', 'This is unbelievable.  Fantastic work.  Very creative and technically so good.  I''m sure you are proud of this one, as you should be.  I can''t believe how many 1, 2 and 3 votes you got ... not sure what they were looking at?  Congrats!!!', '2005-09-29 00:22:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1747190, 232570, 29904, '<td valign="top">Really nice, I like it all, esp the colors!  Really surprized this did not score higher.</td>', 'Really nice, I like it all, esp the colors!  Really surprized this did not score higher.', '2005-09-29 00:27:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1747302, 233050, 5112, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Cole, on a beautiful picture and a great placement.  This really is a fine entry for bubbles.</td>', 'Congratulations, Cole, on a beautiful picture and a great placement.  This really is a fine entry for bubbles.', '2005-09-29 01:24:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1747322, 233764, 2217, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the votes and comments!  Okay, some have asked how I did this, quite simple.  I had a flat pan of water and next to the pan I had a softbox on which I placed some colored plastic strips.  The colors from the strips are reflected onto the water where I placed a few bubbles.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-29 00:38:17.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all the votes and comments!  Okay, some have asked how I did this, quite simple.  I had a flat pan of water and next to the pan I had a softbox on which I placed some colored plastic strips.  The colors from the strips are reflected onto the water where I placed a few bubbles.', '2005-09-29 01:34:19.000000', '2005-09-29 01:38:17.000000', 0),
(1747344, 232886, 13026, '<td valign="top">You are taking over that stupid beach!<br/> <br/>Congrats on another great finish Perry.  :)  Prettyness.</td>', 'You are taking over that stupid beach! Congrats on another great finish Perry.  :)  Prettyness.', '2005-09-29 01:49:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1747418, 233050, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m so glad to know how you did that.  What a wonderful photo.  I gave it one of my highest scores and I''m glad others agreed.  Good one.</td>', 'I''m so glad to know how you did that.  What a wonderful photo.  I gave it one of my highest scores and I''m glad others agreed.  Good one.', '2005-09-29 02:38:35.000000', NULL, 0),
