(1750998, 233831, 41574, '<td valign="top">I must agree with "Koriyama": I really loved this photo, thinking that the model had to pose, while the shot had to have much forced perspective, and the lighting would be just right. I was, indeed, concerned that anybody could do all this in a single shot with minimal computer-editing. Learning how you achieved your results, I''m relieved, but confused as to how this shot was captured in adherence to this site''s rules.</td>', 'I must agree with "Koriyama": I really loved this photo, thinking that the model had to pose, while the shot had to have much forced perspective, and the lighting would be just right. I was, indeed, concerned that anybody could do all this in a single shot with minimal computer-editing. Learning how you achieved your results, I''m relieved, but confused as to how this shot was captured in adherence to this site''s rules.', '2005-09-30 18:57:57.000000', NULL, 0),
