(1752597, 233402, 33696, '<td valign="top">Sorry everyone, "Basic" mistake I just didn''t reallise it was a Basic editing challenge. Just didn''t look at the rules before I entered if it was Basic or Advanced, I just made the photo as I most often do, used one layer in screen mode and one on top of that in soft light mode.<br/>It is very frustrating to loose my first ribbon, because of this "basic" mistake, and I''ll bet you that this wont ever happen again. I''ll be back :)<br/>But to me the main thing is that all of you seemed to have liked the photo, and I am really happy about that. Thank you everyone.</td>', 'Sorry everyone, "Basic" mistake I just didn''t reallise it was a Basic editing challenge. Just didn''t look at the rules before I entered if it was Basic or Advanced, I just made the photo as I most often do, used one layer in screen mode and one on top of that in soft light mode.It is very frustrating to loose my first ribbon, because of this "basic" mistake, and I''ll bet you that this wont ever happen again. I''ll be back :)But to me the main thing is that all of you seemed to have liked the photo, and I am really happy about that. Thank you everyone.', '2005-10-01 16:51:58.000000', NULL, 0),
