(1760996, 234195, 44172, '<td valign="top">Well! I did not want to place in the bottom 10 - that was my goal - so I am very pleased!  Thanks to everyone for all of the comments - it''s great to get feedback in any form!<br/> <br/>This is a photo of my little girl and she did have great fun that afternoon as Mama was taking a zillion pics of her.<br/> <br/>My only gripe is the nine 1''s. Don''t get me wrong - personally I would have voted this a 4 at most because it is very snapshottish, the coloring is a little weird and all - and I don''t believe it deserves the 8''s, 9''s or 10''s either - I assume these were people trying for the brown. But nine 1''s? It clearly met the challenge, and it was in focus - therefore I feel it deserves at least a 2 in the very least! Geesh!</td>', 'Well! I did not want to place in the bottom 10 - that was my goal - so I am very pleased!  Thanks to everyone for all of the comments - it''s great to get feedback in any form! This is a photo of my little girl and she did have great fun that afternoon as Mama was taking a zillion pics of her. My only gripe is the nine 1''s. Don''t get me wrong - personally I would have voted this a 4 at most because it is very snapshottish, the coloring is a little weird and all - and I don''t believe it deserves the 8''s, 9''s or 10''s either - I assume these were people trying for the brown. But nine 1''s? It clearly met the challenge, and it was in focus - therefore I feel it deserves at least a 2 in the very least! Geesh!', '2005-10-05 10:58:05.000000', NULL, 0),
