(4250004, 232077, 58452, '<td valign="top">The eye bubbles didn''t stand a chance.  We have the dribble in immaculate focus!  Plus you went to an extreme to make this difference by shooting F1.4. I like the image but the bubbles, especially from the mouth don''t mean the same thing for me, as for you. ;)<br/>I assume that you shot a version with the eyes in perfect focus and the reflections of bubbles there suffered.  If not, you missed the shot you were looking for.  It sure looks like she is in an altered state.  One might even say meditating. :)  Cute baby.</td>', 'The eye bubbles didn''t stand a chance.  We have the dribble in immaculate focus!  Plus you went to an extreme to make this difference by shooting F1.4. I like the image but the bubbles, especially from the mouth don''t mean the same thing for me, as for you. ;)I assume that you shot a version with the eyes in perfect focus and the reflections of bubbles there suffered.  If not, you missed the shot you were looking for.  It sure looks like she is in an altered state.  One might even say meditating. :)  Cute baby.', '2007-11-15 17:25:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4259200, 232077, 53814, '<td valign="top">I was going to say that I''m amazed that this didn''t win the Posthumous or the OOBIE (or the Metatate)but I guess it was entered before they were given out. This is a very creative shot that slipped through the DPC cracks. Creative shots have a reputation for finding the cracks. Although you did all you could to explain yourself in the title, it seems most people missed the bokeh part. Great shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-11-19 21:55:16.</i></td>', 'I was going to say that I''m amazed that this didn''t win the Posthumous or the OOBIE (or the Metatate)but I guess it was entered before they were given out. This is a very creative shot that slipped through the DPC cracks. Creative shots have a reputation for finding the cracks. Although you did all you could to explain yourself in the title, it seems most people missed the bokeh part. Great shot.', '2007-11-19 21:46:55.000000', '2007-11-19 21:55:16.000000', 0),
